# --- HarmonyOS (OpenHarmony) port -------------------------------------------
# See harmony/README.md. These two rules only ignore our own build artifacts.
# The dependency-override file is the canonical copy in
# harmony/toolchain/pubspec_overrides.yaml, copied to the repo root by the
# build script (pub only reads the root one). Keeping it out of version
# control stops unrelated builds from being forced onto the HarmonyOS
# branches of the plugins.
/saber-ohos-kit/
/pubspec_overrides.yaml
